# Issue tracking — Azure DevOps

Required env: `AZURE_DEVOPS_PAT`, `AZURE_DEVOPS_ORG`, `AZURE_DEVOPS_PROJECT`.

## Operations

<!-- Harness scaffold: integration=azure-devops -->

- Create work item → `mcp__ado__createWorkItem`
- Update state → `mcp__ado__updateWorkItem`
- Comment → `mcp__ado__addWorkItemComment`
- Link parent → `mcp__ado__addWorkItemLink` with `System.LinkTypes.Hierarchy-Reverse`

